WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.088
The Indian language paper doesn't

2
00:00:02.088 --> 00:00:03.515
count in your rank.

3
00:00:03.515 --> 00:00:04.301
But fail it,

4
00:00:04.301 --> 00:00:05.801
and your other Mains papers

5
00:00:05.801 --> 00:00:07.060
aren't marked.

6
00:00:07.389 --> 00:00:09.552
It carries 300 marks.

7
00:00:09.552 --> 00:00:11.454
You need 25 percent to

8
00:00:11.454 --> 00:00:12.637
qualify.

9
00:00:12.987 --> 00:00:14.624
Read the questions before the

10
00:00:14.624 --> 00:00:16.713
passage. Then answer in your

11
00:00:16.713 --> 00:00:17.524
own words,

12
00:00:17.524 --> 00:00:19.865
not by copying whole lines.

13
00:00:20.196 --> 00:00:22.225
Some candidates are exempt,

14
00:00:22.225 --> 00:00:24.697
including those from certain north-eastern

15
00:00:24.697 --> 00:00:25.941
states and Sikkim.

16
00:00:25.941 --> 00:00:27.599
Check the notice.

17
00:00:28.285 --> 00:00:29.456
Your turn.

18
00:00:29.456 --> 00:00:30.711
What do you need to

19
00:00:30.711 --> 00:00:31.747
qualify?
